=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Ayame} for a cut-scene that starts the quest.
* Go to {z:Bastok Mines} and talk with {n:Virnage} at (I-5) for a cut-scene. Agree to his proposal, and you will receive the {@k} {k:Dawn talisman}.
